                        "entry_id": "59c802ad-e7bb-3d4f-bd06-40036b6c8ab7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an untrustworthy manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "177ecd9b-68d0-4cb3-bbec-c36c7f9e09ba",
                                "sense_id": "d7d8755e-7628-3a4c-a2b4-4cc80e3ae468",
                                "text": "A short time ago I proved how superficially and untrustworthily trial trips are carried out; that is characteristic of all the bumptious self-glorification of the English."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "add065cd-e3b3-46cf-b892-e664abbaaa9d",
                                "sense_id": "d7d8755e-7628-3a4c-a2b4-4cc80e3ae468",
                                "text": "Even an ordinary man cannot act untrustworthily: he falls down dead. And if one acts untrustworthily while assembling the high ministers of the overlords, he will certainly not succeed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdc9a072-f591-45cd-87bd-72f5d2a1e9ba",
                                "sense_id": "d7d8755e-7628-3a4c-a2b4-4cc80e3ae468",
                                "text": "If it appears that the applicant has behaved untrustworthily at a previous employer, or even if he appears to feel uncomfortable with this type of questioning, further background checking is a minimum requirement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
